# Files Vercel must NOT deploy as public static assets.
# The repo root holds the real master workbooks (10+ MB of business data)
# and desktop-client/ holds the Electron app — including its renderer
# fallback stub, which fabricates a signed-in admin with no login.
# None of that may be reachable from the deployed site.
# data/materials-index-*.json are excluded here too, but are still bundled
# INTO the api/materials.js function via vercel.json `includeFiles`, so
# the API can read them while browsers cannot download them directly.
# VERIFY on the first Vercel deploy: GET /api/materials?q= must return
# rows. If it 500s with "materials index could not be loaded", the
# includeFiles + .vercelignore interaction needs revisiting.
